OL,3,GNEWSAFive plaques honour firefighters
OL,4,Awho died on duty
OL,5,
OL,6,FA firefighter who died while on duty
OL,7,Fduring the 1940s is among five men to
OL,8,Fbe honoured by new memorial plaques at
OL,9,Fa fire station in South Yorkshire.
OL,11,FEnoch Leadbetter, 37, who was married
OL,12,Fwith four children, was killed by
OL,13,Fcarbon monoxide poisoning while
OL,14,Fsheltering from the cold in a
OL,15,Fpump-towing car which leaked the deadly
OL,16,Fgas as the vehicle relayed water to
OL,17,FHighmoor Colliery in 1943.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
