OL,3,GNEWSAFive plaques honour firefighters
OL,4,Awho died on duty
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeadbetter's name is on one of the red
OL,7,Fplaques to be placed inside Rotherham
OL,8,Ffire station by the Fire Brigades Union
OL,9,F(FBU), with a special ceremony also
OL,10,Fbeing held.
OL,12,FSeveral other memorial plaques to
OL,13,Ffallen colleagues had already been
OL,14,Fplaced elsewhere in South Yorkshire,
OL,15,Fwith up to 20 more planned, the FBU
OL,16,Fsaid.
